  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">This is a Resource Pack that updates the textures of some blocks and items from the mod Fisk's Superheroes to the latest versions of Minecraft (1.14+).</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/660/949/pack.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"594\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">This Pack only works with <span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fiskheroes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fisk's Superheroes</a></span>&nbsp;made by FiskFille. Make sure to download it before installing this Resource Pack.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#396\"><strong>FiskHeroes Updated Textures</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>DOES NOT</strong> </span>include the updated textures for Vanilla, so, for a complete experience, you should download the</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/actually-correct-1-14-texture-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#0f0\">actually correct new default texture backport</span></a></span>&nbsp;Resource Pack:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/actually-correct-1-14-texture-backport/download/3344757\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download actually correct new default texture backport - Minecraft Mods &amp; Modpacks - CurseForge</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>What changed?</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Blocks:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">Titanium Ore</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">Lunar Titanium Ore</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#999\">Lunar Iron Ore</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Lunar Redstone Ore</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc0\">Block of Gold-Titanium</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Items:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">Titanium Ingot</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">Titanium Nugget</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f0f\">Vibranium Ingot</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Dwarf Star Alloy</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc0\">Gold-Titanium Ingot</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc0\">Gold-Titanium Nugget</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>How To Install:</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Download the latest version of <span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fiskheroes/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fisk's Superheroes</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Download <span style=\"color:#396\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fisks-superheroes-updated-textures/files/4559638\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FiskHeroes Updated Textures</strong></a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Open Minecraft</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Click <strong>Options&nbsp;</strong>&gt; click<strong>&nbsp;Resource Packs&nbsp;</strong>&gt; click&nbsp;<strong>Open resource pack folder</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Drag <span style=\"color:#396\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fisks-superheroes-updated-textures/files/4559638\" rel=\"nofollow\">FiskHeroes Updated Textures</a></span></strong> to the folder <strong>(do not unzip the file)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Done!</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>OR...</strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-textures/download/3411093\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">You can download my <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#008000\"><a style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.technicpack.net%252fmodpack%252ffisks-superheroes-1710.1926702%252fabout\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Modpack</strong></a></span>&nbsp;on <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.technicpack.net%252fdownload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Technic Launcher</strong></a></span>, which comes with everything you need to play.</span></p>",
